{"seq":2,"slug":"bluetooth-and-zigbee","title":"蓝牙与 Zigbee 协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/iot-protocols-and-networking/bluetooth-and-zigbee","wordCount":836,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"蓝牙与-zigbee-协议\">蓝牙与 Zigbee 协议</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>蓝牙低功耗（BLE）和 Zigbee 是物联网领域最重要的短距离无线通信协议。BLE 凭借智能手机的原生支持和低功耗特性，在消费电子和可穿戴设备领域占据主导地位；Zigbee 则以自组网 Mesh 拓扑和高可靠性在智能家居和工业传感器网络中广泛部署。两者均工作在 2.4GHz ISM 频段，但在协议架构、组网能力和功耗模型上有本质差异。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[短距离无线协议] --&gt; B[BLE 蓝牙低功耗]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Zigbee]&#10;    B --&gt; D[GATT 服务模型]&#10;    B --&gt; E[广播/连接双模式]&#10;    B --&gt; F[手机原生支持]&#10;    C --&gt; G[Mesh 自组网]&#10;    C --&gt; H[ZCL 集群库]&#10;    C --&gt; I[协调器/路由器/终端]&#10;    A --&gt; J[Thread]&#10;    J --&gt; K[IPv6 Mesh]\">graph TD\n    A[短距离无线协议] --&gt; B[BLE 蓝牙低功耗]\n    A --&gt; C[Zigbee]\n    B --&gt; D[GATT 服务模型]\n    B --&gt; E[广播/连接双模式]\n    B --&gt; F[手机原生支持]\n    C --&gt; G[Mesh 自组网]\n    C --&gt; H[ZCL 集群库]\n    C --&gt; I[协调器/路由器/终端]\n    A --&gt; J[Thread]\n    J --&gt; K[IPv6 Mesh]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>BLE 5.x</th>\n<th>Zigbee 3.0</th>\n<th>Thread 1.3</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>频段</td>\n<td>2.4GHz</td>\n<td>2.4GHz / 868/915MHz</td>\n<td>2.4GHz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据速率</td>\n<td>1-2 Mbps</td>\n<td>250 Kbps</td>\n<td>250 Kbps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通信距离</td>\n<td>10-400m</td>\n<td>10-100m</td>\n<td>10-100m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络拓扑</td>\n<td>星型/Mesh</td>\n<td>星型/树型/Mesh</td>\n<td>Mesh</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大节点数</td>\n<td>理论无限</td>\n<td>65,000</td>\n<td>250+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功耗</td>\n<td>极低（μA 级睡眠）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IP 协议栈</td>\n<td>无（需网关）</td>\n<td>无（需网关）</td>\n<td>原生 IPv6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手机支持</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n<td>需网关</td>\n<td>需 Border Router</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ble-协议栈与-gatt\">BLE 协议栈与 GATT</h2><h3 id=\"协议分层\">协议分层</h3><p>BLE 协议栈分为控制器层（Controller）和主机层（Host），两者通过 HCI（Host Controller Interface）通信：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// BLE GATT 服务定义示例（nRF SDK / Zephyr）&#10;// 定义温度传感器服务&#10;BT_GATT_SERVICE_DEFINE(temp_svc,&#10;    BT_GATT_PRIMARY_SERVICE(BT_UUID_DECLARE_16(0x181A)),&#10;    BT_GATT_CHARACTERISTIC(BT_UUID_DECLARE_16(0x2A6E),&#10;        BT_GATT_CHRC_READ | BT_GATT_CHRC_NOTIFY,&#10;        BT_GATT_PERM_READ,&#10;        read_temperature, NULL, &amp;temperature_value),&#10;    BT_GATT_CCC(temp_ccc_changed, BT_GATT_PERM_READ | BT_GATT_PERM_WRITE),&#10;);&#10;&#10;static ssize_t read_temperature(struct bt_conn *conn,&#10;                                const struct bt_gatt_attr *attr,&#10;                                void *buf, uint16_t len, uint16_t offset) {&#10;    int16_t temp = get_sensor_temperature();&#10;    return bt_gatt_attr_read(conn, attr, buf, len, offset, &amp;temp, sizeof(temp));&#10;}&#10;&#10;static void temp_ccc_changed(const struct bt_gatt_attr *attr, uint16_t value) {&#10;    bool notify_enabled = (value == BT_GATT_CCC_NOTIFY);&#10;    if (notify_enabled) {&#10;        start_temperature_notification_timer();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// BLE GATT 服务定义示例（nRF SDK / Zephyr）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 定义温度传感器服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">BT_GATT_SERVICE_DEFINE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(temp_svc,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    BT_GATT_PRIMARY_SERVICE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">BT_UUID_DECLARE_16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">181A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    BT_GATT_CHARACTERISTIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">BT_UUID_DECLARE_16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2A6E</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        BT_GATT_CHRC_READ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BT_GATT_CHRC_NOTIFY,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        BT_GATT_PERM_READ,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        read_temperature, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">temperature_value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    BT_GATT_CCC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(temp_ccc_changed, BT_GATT_PERM_READ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BT_GATT_PERM_WRITE),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ssize_t</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> read_temperature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bt_conn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">conn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bt_gatt_attr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">attr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">buf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint16_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint16_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> offset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int16_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> get_sensor_temperature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bt_gatt_attr_read</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(conn, attr, buf, len, offset, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">temp, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(temp));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> temp_ccc_changed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bt_gatt_attr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">attr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint16_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> notify_enabled </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BT_GATT_CCC_NOTIFY);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (notify_enabled) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        start_temperature_notification_timer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ble-广播与扫描\">BLE 广播与扫描</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// BLE 广播数据配置&#10;static const struct bt_data ad[] = {&#10;    BT_DATA_BYTES(BT_DATA_FLAGS, (BT_LE_AD_GENERAL | BT_LE_AD_NO_BREDR)),&#10;    BT_DATA_BYTES(BT_DATA_UUID16_ALL, 0x1A, 0x18),  // 环境传感服务&#10;};&#10;&#10;static const struct bt_data sd[] = {&#10;    BT_DATA(BT_DATA_NAME_COMPLETE, &quot;TempSensor&quot;, 10),&#10;};&#10;&#10;// 开始广播&#10;bt_le_adv_start(BT_LE_ADV_CONN_NAME, ad, ARRAY_SIZE(ad), sd, ARRAY_SIZE(sd));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// BLE 广播数据配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bt_data ad</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    BT_DATA_BYTES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(BT_DATA_FLAGS, (BT_LE_AD_GENERAL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BT_LE_AD_NO_BREDR)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    BT_DATA_BYTES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(BT_DATA_UUID16_ALL, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 环境传感服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bt_data sd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    BT_DATA</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(BT_DATA_NAME_COMPLETE, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"TempSensor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 开始广播</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bt_le_adv_start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(BT_LE_ADV_CONN_NAME, ad, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ARRAY_SIZE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ad), sd, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ARRAY_SIZE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sd));</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>BLE 广播类型</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>可连接</th>\n<th>数据量</th>\n<th>功耗</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ADV_IND</td>\n<td>通用广播</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>31 字节</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ADV_DIRECT_IND</td>\n<td>定向连接</td>\n<td>是（指定设备）</td>\n<td>无附加</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ADV_NONCONN_IND</td>\n<td>信标广播</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>31 字节</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ADV_SCAN_IND</td>\n<td>可扫描广播</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>31+31 字节</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Extended ADV（BLE 5）</td>\n<td>扩展广播</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>255 字节</td>\n<td>可配置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"zigbee-mesh-网络\">Zigbee Mesh 网络</h2><h3 id=\"网络角色与拓扑\">网络角色与拓扑</h3><p>Zigbee 网络由三种角色组成：协调器（Coordinator）负责网络创建和管理，路由器（Router）转发数据并扩展覆盖范围，终端设备（End Device）通常是电池供电的传感器。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A((协调器)) --&gt; B[路由器 1]&#10;    A --&gt; C[路由器 2]&#10;    B --&gt; D[终端设备 1]&#10;    B --&gt; E[终端设备 2]&#10;    C --&gt; F[路由器 3]&#10;    C --&gt; G[终端设备 3]&#10;    F --&gt; H[终端设备 4]&#10;    B -.-&gt; C&#10;    C -.-&gt; B\">graph TD\n    A((协调器)) --&gt; B[路由器 1]\n    A --&gt; C[路由器 2]\n    B --&gt; D[终端设备 1]\n    B --&gt; E[终端设备 2]\n    C --&gt; F[路由器 3]\n    C --&gt; G[终端设备 3]\n    F --&gt; H[终端设备 4]\n    B -.-&gt; C\n    C -.-&gt; B</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// Zigbee 集群操作示例（Z-Stack / ZBOSS）&#10;// 发送温度测量值&#10;void send_temperature_report(uint8_t endpoint) {&#10;    zb_zcl_attr_t attr_list[] = {&#10;        {&#10;            .id = ZB_ZCL_ATTR_TEMP_MEASUREMENT_VALUE_ID,&#10;            .type = ZB_ZCL_ATTR_TYPE_S16,&#10;            .access = ZB_ZCL_ATTR_ACCESS_READ_ONLY | ZB_ZCL_ATTR_ACCESS_REPORTING,&#10;            .data_p = &amp;measured_temperature,&#10;        },&#10;    };&#10;&#10;    zb_zcl_reporting_info_t rep_info = {&#10;        .direction = ZB_ZCL_CONFIGURE_REPORTING_SEND_REPORT,&#10;        .ep = endpoint,&#10;        .cluster_id = ZB_ZCL_CLUSTER_ID_TEMP_MEASUREMENT,&#10;        .min_interval = 10,&#10;        .max_interval = 300,&#10;        .delta.s16 = 50,  // 温度变化 0.5°C 时上报&#10;    };&#10;    zb_zcl_put_reporting_info(&amp;rep_info);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Zigbee 集群操作示例（Z-Stack / ZBOSS）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 发送温度测量值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> send_temperature_report</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    zb_zcl_attr_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attr_list</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ZB_ZCL_ATTR_TEMP_MEASUREMENT_VALUE_ID,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ZB_ZCL_ATTR_TYPE_S16,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .access </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ZB_ZCL_ATTR_ACCESS_READ_ONLY </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ZB_ZCL_ATTR_ACCESS_REPORTING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .data_p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">measured_temperature,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    zb_zcl_reporting_info_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rep_info </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .direction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ZB_ZCL_CONFIGURE_REPORTING_SEND_REPORT,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .ep </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> endpoint,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .cluster_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ZB_ZCL_CLUSTER_ID_TEMP_MEASUREMENT,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .min_interval </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .max_interval </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .delta.s16 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 温度变化 0.5°C 时上报</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    zb_zcl_put_reporting_info</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">rep_info);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"zigbee-vs-ble-mesh\">Zigbee vs BLE Mesh</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Zigbee Mesh</th>\n<th>BLE Mesh</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>路由方式</td>\n<td>AODV（按需路由）</td>\n<td>泛洪（Managed Flooding）</td>\n<td>Zigbee 更节省带宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络容量</td>\n<td>65,000 节点</td>\n<td>32,767 节点</td>\n<td>Zigbee 支持更大规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功耗模型</td>\n<td>终端设备可睡眠</td>\n<td>低功耗节点（LPN）</td>\n<td>两者均支持低功耗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全性</td>\n<td>网络密钥 + 链路密钥</td>\n<td>NetKey + AppKey</td>\n<td>安全模型类似</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>互操作性</td>\n<td>ZCL 标准集群</td>\n<td>Mesh Model</td>\n<td>Zigbee 生态更成熟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手机直连</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>BLE Mesh 优势</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"matter-统一标准\">Matter 统一标准</h2><p>Matter（原 CHIP）由 CSA（Connectivity Standards Alliance）制定，旨在统一智能家居协议碎片化问题。Matter 基于 IPv6 运行在 Wi-Fi、Thread 和 BLE 之上，提供统一的设备模型和安全框架：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Matter 特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传输层</td>\n<td>Wi-Fi / Thread / BLE（配网）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络层</td>\n<td>IPv6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>CASE（证书认证） + PASE（密码认证）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备模型</td>\n<td>统一的 Cluster（类似 ZCL）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多管理器</td>\n<td>支持多个生态系统同时控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地控制</td>\n<td>不依赖云服务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>BLE 凭借手机原生支持和极低功耗，是消费 IoT 的首选短距离协议</li>\n<li>Zigbee 的 Mesh 自组网和成熟的 ZCL 集群库使其在智能家居和工业 IoT 中保持强势地位</li>\n<li>BLE 的 GATT 服务模型适合点对点数据交换，Zigbee 的路由机制适合大规模 Mesh 网络</li>\n<li>Thread 协议引入原生 IPv6 支持，简化了 IoT 设备的 IP 互联</li>\n<li>Matter 标准正在统一智能家居协议碎片化，底层可运行在 Wi-Fi、Thread 和 BLE 之上</li>\n<li>选型时需综合考虑手机兼容性、网络规模、功耗预算和生态成熟度</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"蓝牙与 Zigbee 协议","id":"蓝牙与-zigbee-协议"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"BLE 协议栈与 GATT","id":"ble-协议栈与-gatt"},{"level":3,"text":"协议分层","id":"协议分层"},{"level":3,"text":"BLE 广播与扫描","id":"ble-广播与扫描"},{"level":2,"text":"Zigbee Mesh 网络","id":"zigbee-mesh-网络"},{"level":3,"text":"网络角色与拓扑","id":"网络角色与拓扑"},{"level":3,"text":"Zigbee vs BLE Mesh","id":"zigbee-vs-ble-mesh"},{"level":2,"text":"Matter 统一标准","id":"matter-统一标准"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"MQTT 与 CoAP 协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/iot-protocols-and-networking/mqtt-and-coap"},"next":{"title":"LoRa 与低功耗广域网","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/iot-protocols-and-networking/lora-and-lpwan"}}